<title>UK: Berisford in 10 mln stg agribusiness sales.</title>
<headline>Berisford in 10 mln stg agribusiness sales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Berisford Plc said it had sold almost all the agribusiness assets of its subsidiaries Germains Inc and W-L Research Inc to Agri-Biotech Inc for 10 million stg.</p>
<p>It said the amount was equivalent to the current book value of the business sold.</p>
<p>In the 12 months to September 30, 1995, the operating profit of its agribusiness division was 0.2 million stg, Berisford said in a statement.</p>
<p>Berisford said the sale would be used for the ongoing development of the group.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
